<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9488"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ozdude<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ozdude<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 1:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ref your point on his temper...for what it&#39;s worth one of the articles in today&#39;s Eagle, all of section A which is the front page section contained all BTK stories, had comments from a co-worker from ADT stating he cursed him out and was seen pounding on the hood of a work vehicle during a rant, because he was so mad..LaMunyon said his letters went from very angry in the 70&#39;s to nicer this last year...who knows<!--/Text--></td></tr>
